{
  "id": "LoanEngWorkflowC",
  "name": "C - Match Notifications",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow C - notifications\nTriggered by Workflow B only after matching COMPLETED.\n\nThe backend groups matches into **one email per user**, creates notification_logs rows keyed by an idempotency key and returns only rows still to send, so retries never resend.\n\nEvery message goes to **NOTIFICATION_TEST_RECIPIENT** - never to CSV addresses.\n\nDelivery mode comes from the backend (NOTIFICATION_MODE):\n- dry_run: nothing sent, logged as DRY_RUN\n- smtp: local Mailpit catcher\n- ses: AWS SES\n\nEach outcome (SENT / FAILED + error) is reported back. Failed rows are not retried automatically: they are re-sent (max 3 attempts) the next time this workflow runs for the batch, e.g. after POST /internal/batches/{id}/trigger-matching.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 360
      },
      "id": "dc4517f5-371c-590a-bdba-106fa08b1ce5",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "loan-notify",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8d6af970-b680-561b-bb14-e36f23342253",
      "name": "Matching completed webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "LoanEngWebhook01",
          "name": "Loan Engine Webhook Token (X-Webhook-Token)"
        }
      },
      "webhookId": "5c9289b2-a93a-5b69-9d38-c70c7515748e"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Accept only a UUID batch id from the webhook body; reject anything else.\nconst body = $json.body || {};\nconst id = String(body.upload_batch_id || '');\nif (!/^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i.test(id)) {\n  throw new Error('upload_batch_id missing or not a UUID');\n}\nreturn [{ json: { upload_batch_id: id, received_at: new Date().toISOString() } }];"
      },
      "id": "e1e429be-89a8-5f6e-b5c1-463fa216295d",
      "name": "Validate payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ ($env.LOAN_API_BASE_URL || 'http://api:8000') + '/internal/notifications/' + $json.upload_batch_id + '/prepare' }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "id": "17e8f921-a7e8-5c9a-abf6-157c2ed91000",
      "name": "Prepare grouped outbox",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "LoanEngInternal1",
          "name": "Loan Engine Internal API (X-Internal-Token)"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const out = $json.messages || [];\nreturn out.map(m => ({ json: m }));"
      },
      "id": "76354cf3-5ba7-5cdd-8be9-4aa2cefcc2ac",
      "name": "One item per message",
